From 23b3822fa424ae6d0444dafeea8adec412504528 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Emergi Idan <idan.emergi@intel.com>
Date: Sun, 19 Apr 2020 18:19:04 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] PONRTSYS-7747: Fix minimum guarantee configuration

Use different groups for policies who use the same
set of pools
Disable minimum guarantee hw logic for pools which
are used by 1 policy only
Add unit-tests for buffer manager
Fix Falcon compatibility issues

Signed-off-by: Emergi Idan <idan.emergi@intel.com>
